This repository contains a patch to SGLang v0.5.18
(https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang, tag v0.5.18, commit 71de97b),
Copyright 2023-2024 SGLang Team, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. patch/peak_kv_reservation.diff modifies these SGLang files:

    python/sglang/srt/server_args.py               +17 lines
    python/sglang/srt/managers/scheduler.py         +5 lines
    python/sglang/srt/managers/schedule_policy.py  +80 lines

for a total of 102 added and 0 removed lines (+102/-0). The change is off
by default and is enabled with --enable-peak-kv-reservation. See
patch/README.md for what it changes and how to apply it.

third_party/sglang_v0_5_18/ contains one unmodified file from SGLang
v0.5.18, python/sglang/srt/managers/schedule_policy.py, with its original
copyright and license header, together with SGLang's LICENSE file. It is
used only by the CPU tests.

The raw data published as the GitHub Release asset "data-v1"
(w3-raw-v1.tar.xz, not stored in git) contains text generated by the model
Qwen/Qwen3-4B (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B, revision
1cfa9a7208912126459214e8b04321603b3df60c), Copyright 2024 Alibaba Cloud,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The model weights are not
included.

The course harness (workload definitions, trace generator, and the
replay and metrics tools of https://github.com/mlleo/inference-engine-study)
is not included in this repository. tools/fetch_course_harness.sh fetches it
separately, for GPU reproduction and trace regeneration only.
